/S /H4
/T (A heater Control Unit \(HCU\) is a free-standing power supply unit designed to deliver thermostatically controlled low-voltage power supply to the heater pads attached under each wired tray in a bulk rack assembly/vial stoppering mechanism. The heat energy produced by the heater pads enhances the drying rate. The complete set comes with the heater control box, bulk rack assembly / vial stoppering mechanism. )
