<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Pre-freezing Glycol bath is meant to freeze materials in round bottom flasks before loading them on the freeze dryer. The pre-freezer bath can achieve a temperature range of -40C. The rotation mechanism of the pre-freeze bath helps the sample in the flask to freeze to a thin layer on the inner walls of the flask which promotes faster drying and reduce time.)
/E (Pre-freezing Glycol bath is meant to freeze materials in round bottom flasks before loading them on the freeze dryer. The pre-freezer bath can achieve a temperature range of -40C. The rotation mechanism of the pre-freeze bath helps the sample in the flask to freeze to a thin layer on the inner walls of the flask which promotes faster drying and reduce time.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [48]
>>
